<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>报告解释 · {{ date_str }}</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f6f7f8;
      color: #1a1d21;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #1e5aa8;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 .25rem;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #5a626a;
      font-size: .95rem;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .prompts {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .details-block {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d4d8dc;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    summary {
      padding: .9rem 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: #f6f7f8;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
    }

    details[open] summary {
      border-bottom-color: #e9ecef;
    }

    .details-body {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    pre {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "Source Code Pro", Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: .8rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      background: #f1f3f5;
      border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1rem;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
      overflow-x: auto;
      color: #1a1d21;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #d4d8dc;
      font-size: .8rem;
      color: #5a626a;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .container { padding: 1rem; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>报告解释 · {{ date_str }}</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">本期论文推送的判定依据与 Prompt 快照</div>
    </header>

    <section class="prompts">
      <h2>完整 Prompt 快照</h2>

      <details class="details-block" open>
        <summary>Phase E — 相关性判断</summary>
        <div class="details-body">
          <pre>{{ relevance_prompt | e }}</pre>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="details-block">
        <summary>Phase F — 论文总结</summary>
        <div class="details-body">
          <pre>{{ summary_prompt | e }}</pre>
        </div>
      </details>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <span>生成时间：{{ generated_at }}</span>
      <span>PapersCrawler</span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
